      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.message.chat.id }}",
        "text": "=👋 Hi {{ $json.message.from.first_name || 'there' }}! I'm {{ $('Config').first().json.assistant_name }}, your new AI assistant.\n\n🔐 Your chat ID is: <code>{{ $json.message.chat.id }}</code>\n\nPaste it into the <b>Config</b> node → <b>allowed_chat_id</b> and save the workflow. After that I'll only listen to you — and I'm ready to manage your calendar, emails and to-dos. 🚀",
